{"RukuNumber":393,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":27,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا خَلَقۡنَا ٱلسَّمَآءَ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَا بَٰطِلٗاۚ ذَٰلِكَ ظَنُّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْۚ فَوَيۡلٞ لِّلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ مِنَ ٱلنَّارِ","TajweedText":"وَمَا خَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا بَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>طِل<tajweed class=ikhafa>اً‌ۚ ذ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ ظَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ‌ۚ</tajweed> فَوَيْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>لٌ ل</tajweed>ِّلَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed>رِ <span class=end>٢٧</span>","End":"٢٧","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":28,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ نَجۡعَلُ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ كَٱلۡمُفۡسِدِينَ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ أَمۡ نَجۡعَلُ ٱلۡمُتَّقِينَ كَٱلۡفُجَّارِ","TajweedText":"أَمْ نَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عَلُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَعَمِلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِحَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ كَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُفْسِدِينَ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ أَمْ نَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عَلُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُتَّقِينَ كَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْفُجّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed>رِ <span class=end>٢٨</span>","End":"٢٨","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":29,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"كِتَٰبٌ أَنزَلۡنَٰهُ إِلَيۡكَ مُبَٰرَكٞ لِّيَدَّبَّرُوٓاْ ءَايَٰتِهِۦ وَلِيَتَذَكَّرَ أُوْلُواْ ٱلۡأَلۡبَٰبِ","TajweedText":"كِتَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بٌ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>َلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ إِلَيْكَ مُبَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>كٌ ل</tajweed>ِّيَدَّبَّر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> ءَايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> وَلِيَتَذَكَّرَ أُ<tajweed class=slnt>وْ</tajweed>لُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَلْبَ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>٢٩</span>","End":"٢٩","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":30,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَوَهَبۡنَا لِدَاوُۥدَ سُلَيۡمَٰنَۚ نِعۡمَ ٱلۡعَبۡدُ إِنَّهُۥٓ أَوَّابٌ","TajweedText":"وَوَهَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>نَا لِدَاوُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed>دَ سُلَيْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَ‌ۚ نِعْمَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>دُ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> أَوّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ٌ <span class=end>٣٠</span>","End":"٣٠","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":31,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِذۡ عُرِضَ عَلَيۡهِ بِٱلۡعَشِيِّ ٱلصَّـٰفِنَٰتُ ٱلۡجِيَادُ","TajweedText":"إِذْ عُرِضَ عَلَيْهِ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَشِىِّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فِنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجِي<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ُ <span class=end>٣١</span>","End":"٣١","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":32,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَقَالَ إِنِّيٓ أَحۡبَبۡتُ حُبَّ ٱلۡخَيۡرِ عَن ذِكۡرِ رَبِّي حَتَّىٰ تَوَارَتۡ بِٱلۡحِجَابِ","TajweedText":"فَقَالَ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَحْبَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>تُ حُبَّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْخَيْرِ عَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ذ</tajweed>ِكْرِ رَبِّى حَتَّىٰ تَوَارَتْ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحِج<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>٣٢</span>","End":"٣٢","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"رُدُّوهَا عَلَيَّۖ فَطَفِقَ مَسۡحَۢا بِٱلسُّوقِ وَٱلۡأَعۡنَاقِ","TajweedText":"رُدُّوهَا عَلَىَّ‌ۖ فَطَفِقَ مَسْح<tajweed class=iqlab>َۢا ب</tajweed>ِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سُّوقِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَعْن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَقَدۡ فَتَنَّا سُلَيۡمَٰنَ وَأَلۡقَيۡنَا عَلَىٰ كُرۡسِيِّهِۦ جَسَدٗا ثُمَّ أَنَابَ","TajweedText":"وَلَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> فَتَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا سُلَيْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَ وَأَلْقَيْنَا عَلَىٰ كُرْسِيِّه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> جَسَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>دًا ث</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ أَن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>َ <span class=end>٣٤</span>","End":"٣٤","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":35,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ رَبِّ ٱغۡفِرۡ لِي وَهَبۡ لِي مُلۡكٗا لَّا يَنۢبَغِي لِأَحَدٖ مِّنۢ بَعۡدِيٓۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلۡوَهَّابُ","TajweedText":"قَالَ رَبِّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>غْفِرْ لِى وَهَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed> لِى مُلْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>كًا ل</tajweed>َّا يَ<tajweed class=iqlab>نۢب</tajweed>َغِى لِأَحَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>دٍ م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=iqlab>ِنۢ ب</tajweed>َعْد<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ‌ۖ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكَ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْوَهّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ُ <span class=end>٣٥</span>","End":"٣٥","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":36,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَسَخَّرۡنَا لَهُ ٱلرِّيحَ تَجۡرِي بِأَمۡرِهِۦ رُخَآءً حَيۡثُ أَصَابَ","TajweedText":"فَسَخَّرْنَا لَهُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رِّيحَ تَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>رِى بِأَمْرِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> رُخ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءً حَيْثُ أَص<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>َ <span class=end>٣٦</span>","End":"٣٦","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":37,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱلشَّيَٰطِينَ كُلَّ بَنَّآءٖ وَغَوَّاصٖ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>شَّيَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>طِينَ كُلَّ بَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ءٍ و</tajweed>َغَوّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed>صٍ <span class=end>٣٧</span>","End":"٣٧","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَءَاخَرِينَ مُقَرَّنِينَ فِي ٱلۡأَصۡفَادِ","TajweedText":"وَءَاخَرِينَ مُقَرَّنِينَ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَصْف<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":455,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":393,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"هَٰذَا عَطَآؤُنَا فَٱمۡنُنۡ أَوۡ أَمۡسِكۡ بِغَيۡرِ حِسَابٖ","TajweedText":"هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا عَط<tajweed class=